  "description": "“To become an immortal, one must live a strictly ascetic life.” \n\nYeongsu, a white tiger beastkin who must take the immortal exam in order to become a god, begins to question his desire for divinity after falling in love with Bomi, a human woman. On the day he finally gathers the courage to visit her, Bomi becomes possessed by a frustrated god and starts seducing Yeongsu openly. Unaware of the truth, Yeongsu gradually loses his reason under Bomi’s touch. \n\n“Then all I have to do is satisfy you, right, teacher?” \n\nIn the end, he accepts her proposal…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14145919)",
